# The parametric-store library is LOCAL, like the gitignored asset pack in
# docs/ASSETS.md. It's seeded from an external Thingiverse-style folder by
# core/scad/scad_import.gd and catalogued by core/scad/scad_ingest.gd, and each
# .scad carries its original author's own CC license (pending-verification until
# confirmed — see CREDITS.md / credits/credits.json, which IS the committed
# attribution record). None of it belongs in the public repo yet.
#
# Ignore everything here except the docs that explain the folder.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md

# Once a part's license is verified (and is not CC-BY-NC / CC-BY-ND), you can
# force-add just that file:  git add -f scad_library/<category>/<...>/<file>.scad
